  "helpTeamHere": "Our support team is here to help",
  "helpT1Title": "Tasks & Applications",
  "helpT1Sub": "Manage applications, bids, slot details, and cover letters",
  "helpT1Q1": "How do I apply for a task?",
  "helpT1A1": "Browse available tasks in the Browse tab, select a task that matches your expertise, choose your bid amount, write a brief cover letter describing your experience, and tap Apply.",
  "helpT1Q2": "Can I cancel or withdraw my application?",
  "helpT1A2": "Yes. Go to My Applications on the Profile tab, choose the pending application you want to withdraw, and tap the Withdraw option to remove your bid.",
  "helpT1Q3": "What happens when my application is accepted?",
  "helpT1A3": "You will receive an instant notification, and the task moves to your \"My Active Tasks\" shelf. You can open the task to view customer details and coordinates.",
  "helpT1Q4": "What is the task completion OTP?",
  "helpT1A4": "Upon successfully completing the task, ask the customer for the 4-digit verification OTP. Enter it in the active task window to mark it completed and release your payout.",
  "helpT1Q5": "What happens if a customer cancels a task after I arrive?",
  "helpT1A5": "If a customer cancels after you have arrived or started traveling to the location, you may be eligible for a cancellation compensation of ₹50-₹150 depending on the distance traveled. Contact support via the active booking screen.",
  "helpT1Q6": "How are task ratings calculated?",
  "helpT1A6": "Your overall rating is the average of ratings given by customers upon task completion. High ratings (4.5+) increase your visibility and give you early access to high-value tasks.",
  "helpT2Title": "Earnings & Payouts",
  "helpT2Sub": "Platform fees, bank withdrawals, and ledger payments",
  "helpT2Q1": "How do I withdraw my earnings?",
  "helpT2A1": "Go to Earnings & Payouts from your Profile, tap Withdraw, enter the amount (min ₹100), and the funds are instantly transferred to your default payout target.",
  "helpT2Q2": "What is the platform service fee?",
  "helpT2A2": "TaskTeddy charges a flat 15% platform service fee on successful task completions to help pay for insurance, marketing, and operations.",
  "helpT2Q3": "How long does a withdrawal bank payout take?",
  "helpT2A3": "Payout transfers are initiated instantly. Depending on your bank's IMPS processing speeds, payouts usually reflect in your bank account or UPI within a few minutes.",
  "helpT2Q4": "Why is my payout stuck in pending status?",
  "helpT2A4": "If your payout is pending, it's usually due to a banking network delay or verification check. Most pending payouts resolve automatically within 2-4 hours. If it takes longer, reach out with the Payout ID.",
  "helpT2Q5": "Can I change my default payout bank account?",
  "helpT2A5": "Yes, you can edit or add bank accounts and UPI IDs anytime via the Bank & Payout screen on your Profile tab. Simply add a new method and tap the star or set as default.",
  "helpT3Title": "Verification & Profile",
  "helpT3Sub": "Aadhaar checks, PAN verification, and profile picture settings",
  "helpT3Q1": "How long does document verification take?",
  "helpT3A1": "Automated background checks are verified instantly. In cases requiring manual reviews, approval can take up to 24 hours. Your progress bar updates automatically.",
  "helpT3Q2": "What address proofs are acceptable?",
  "helpT3A2": "We accept standard utility bills (electricity, pipeline gas, or water bill) not older than 3 months, registered rent agreements, or government certificates in your name.",
  "helpT3Q3": "Why was my PAN card upload rejected?",
  "helpT3A3": "Ensure that the photo is clear, all edges are visible, there is no flash reflection, and the name matches your government ID details.",
  "helpT3Q4": "How do I update my profile details after verification?",
  "helpT3A4": "Once your identity is verified, major fields like your legal name and government ID cannot be edited directly. To change your registered phone number or correct a name error, contact partner support with supporting documents.",
  "helpT3Q5": "What should I do if my document verification fails?",
  "helpT3A5": "If your Aadhaar or PAN is rejected, you will receive a notification stating the reason. Make sure your upload is high-quality, not blurred, and matches your registered profile name before submitting again.",
  "helpT4Title": "Safety & Code of Conduct",
  "helpT4Sub": "Emergency support, coordinates tracking, and rules",
  "helpT4Q1": "I feel unsafe during a task - what do I do?",
  "helpT4A1": "Safety is our top priority. Leave the location immediately to a public space and call support. In any emergency, dial local police (100/112) first.",
  "helpT4Q2": "Can I accept payments directly from customers?",
  "helpT4A2": "No. Asking customers for offline or direct cash/UPI transfers violates partner guidelines and leads to permanent suspension of your TaskTeddy account.",
  "helpT4Q3": "What should I do if the task scope changes at the location?",
  "helpT4A3": "If a customer asks you to do additional work not mentioned in the original task description, politely ask them to update the task in the app or pay standard rates. Do not accept offline payment adjustments without informing support.",
  "helpT4Q4": "How is my location tracked during active tasks?",
  "helpT4A4": "We track your location in the background only when you are traveling to a task or actively completing a service, to ensure partner safety and provide customers with live ETAs.",
